== 4. Figure decisions ========================================= 
  FIXED HERE, and stated in the legends: 
    - one colour scale per gene, shared across sections, capped at 
      the 99.5th percentile 
    - scales NOT shared between genes, because PRAME is ~30x more 
      abundant and a common scale would hide RASSF9 entirely 
    - raw counts per 10,000 within spot, log1p -- matching script 30, 
      not the object's SCT values 
    - high values drawn last, so positives are not buried by zeros 
    - scale bar from each section's own scalefactors_json 
    - no titles or captions in the image; legends in 
      results/figure_legends_geo.md 
 
